      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句：attn_output, attn_output_weights = self.multihead_attn(query, key, value)。该算子计算注意力权重矩阵。",
        "输入 q, k 已经 reshape 为 [batch, num_heads, seq_len, head_dim]。计算每个 batch 和 head 的注意力分数：scores = q @ k.transpose(-2, -1) / sqrt(head_dim)，然后对最后一个维度做 softmax，得到形状 [batch, num_heads, seq_len, seq_len]。",
        "返回平均后的注意力权重：对 head 维度求平均，形状 [batch, seq_len, seq_len]。注意 average_attn_weights=True（默认），返回的权重已在所有 head 上平均。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "output_projection_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "attn_output",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, seq_len, embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
